.TH HUGINN 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded b06c570c" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
huginn \- Huginn: report bare\-metal host metrics (CPU, memory, disks, network, processes) to the dashboard and VictoriaMetrics (ADR\-084).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B huginn
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Huginn: report bare\-metal host metrics (CPU, memory, disks, network, processes) to the dashboard and VictoriaMetrics (ADR\-084).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-config \fISTRING\fR
path to YAML config file (optional) (default /etc/huginn.yaml)
.TP
.B \-\-host \fISTRING\fR
host label override (default: hostname or config)
.TP
.B \-\-interval \fIDURATION\fR
collection/push interval override
.TP
.B \-\-listen \fISTRING\fR
listen address override
.TP
.B \-\-vm \fISTRING\fR
VictoriaMetrics URL override (empty string = no override)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
huginn
huginn \-\-config /etc/huginn.yaml
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
